# Build context: backend/. The image regenerates gen/ with protoc, so a local
# copy must not leak in: `COPY . .` would carry a stale file from a removed
# .proto into the build, to be compiled alongside the fresh output. The
# frontend image already guards against the same thing (see /.dockerignore).
gen/

# Local build and test artifacts
bookstore-server
*.test
*.out

# Secrets
.env
